ub.com/user-attachments/assets/1b60b52a-6bf2-4caf-b18d-cce847279f03\" /> |\n\n*\"Normal Map Disabled\" means disabling the normal map import option of the texture and reimporting*\n\nI do also want to note that this makes it possible to use the RGTC format with similar quality to BPTC_RGBA again.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3425735881/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]